WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.560 line:12% align:center
The tide is out!

00:00:01.660 --> 00:00:04.307 line:12% align:center
Grab everything that glitters

00:00:04.407 --> 00:00:05.921 line:12% align:center
A full bag slows you down

00:00:06.071 --> 00:00:08.878 line:12% align:center
Just one more…?

00:00:08.978 --> 00:00:12.021 line:12% align:center
Tide's coming. Run!

00:00:12.171 --> 00:00:14.821 line:12% align:center
Phew, made it!

00:00:15.021 --> 00:00:19.871 line:12% align:center
Build with what you bring back

00:00:20.071 --> 00:00:22.921 line:12% align:center
Reach places you couldn't before

00:00:23.021 --> 00:00:24.571 line:12% align:center
Until the empty island is a village

00:00:25.071 --> 00:00:27.121 line:12% align:center
Low Tide Island — One thumb. Back before the tide.
